{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21626","headline":"贻蜀五首 韦兵曹臧文 · 元稹","name":"贻蜀五首 韦兵曹臧文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"处处侯门可曳裙，人人争事蜀尚书。\n摩天气直山曾拔，澈底心清水共虚。\n鹏翼已翻君好去，乌头未变我何如。\n殷勤爲话深相感，不学冯谖待食鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}